  "question": {
    "text": "Let <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></em> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are two independent events such that <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math><mn>9</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />So, <math><mn>9</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
  }
